                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The fraction for Total Sky Cover  in tenths of coverage.
(eg. 1 is 1/10 covered. 10 is total coverage). Total Sky Cover is
the amount of the sky dome covered by clouds or obscuring phenomena.
Minium value is 0; maximum value is 10; missing value is 99.</item>
